  "body_html": "<p>Łowco, towarzyszy ci zwierzę, z którym łączy cię głęboka więź i z którym porozumiewasz się bez słów. Traktuj je jak stronnika.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"animal-companion\" data-hp-key=\"companion\" data-label=\"Animal Companion\">\n<h2 id=\"your-companion\">Twój towarzysz</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Imię</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"imię\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Etykiety obrażeń</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:damage-tags\" placeholder=\"hand, …\" aria-label=\"ręka, …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:max-hp\" data-default=\"5\" value=\"5\" aria-label=\"Maks. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Maks. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:armor\" data-default=\"1\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pancerz\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Pancerz</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:damage\" data-default=\"d4\" value=\"d4\" aria-label=\"Obrażenia\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d4\" title=\"Rzuć na obrażenia\">Obrażenia</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">Ustal Maks. HP, Pancerz i Obrażenia według typu wybranego poniżej (patrz Typ).</p>\n<h3 id=\"type\">Typ</h3>\n<p>Wybierz 1.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type0-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type0-pick\" data-check-id=\"type0-pick\"> <strong>Ptak</strong></label> <span class=\"fs-muted\">(sokół, orzeł, sowa, myszołów, sroka, <input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type0-other\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"stat-line\">HP 5; Pancerz 1 (rozmiar); Obrażenia d4 (<em>ręka</em>)</p>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">Wybierz 4 kolejne:</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-0\" data-check-id=\"type0-0\"> <span>Lepsza kość obrażeń (d6)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-1\" data-check-id=\"type0-1\"> <span>+4 HP</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-2\" data-check-id=\"type0-2\"> <span>+1 pancerza (zwinność)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-3\" data-check-id=\"type0-3\"> <span><em>ptak bojowy</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-ch